From 35c58aac1d57ceeac0da504d8e9ecbae77bc54fd Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jefferson Nascimento <jnsagai@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 7 Oct 2026 04:54:16 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Rust::com: Add mock runtime for the Rust COM-API (draft)

Addresses #490 (draft, not ready for review).

Add an in-process mock runtime (registry-backed find_service, publisher
and subscription) for testing Rust COM-API applications without LoLa.
Not yet verified: its test group failed while loading Bazel module
extensions before any test ran.

Implemented with DeepSeek V4 Flash (Fabro).

Assisted-by: Anthropic Claude Opus 5.5 (reported in original metadata)
Assisted-by: DeepSeek V4 Flash (Fabro)
Assisted-by: OpenAI Codex (version not retained)
